, cercado pelos melhores restaurantes, serviços e a conveniência de um estilo de vida cosmopolita e seguro.\n\nAgende sua visita e conheça este apartamento exclusivo no Batel!","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/74ede875-e53b-4ec5-baf5-664ddce83fa9.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5efa8c7f-8716-4ebb-abbb-137517014a8b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5f518b4c-de6e-45a5-bb5f-c2533fcdee1d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/171bbd13-3322-44cb-b130-eb46f7f42f3b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9be64fa1-9d16-4363-aac0-76ce2f2f9777.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e0feccda-27cf-40c6-ad79-9476fa45efa2.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/04893c88-ae4a-402f-b0bd-d1215e5b780a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5f22ea04-282f-4beb-8a06-f53fc8d5fc51.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9037df72-6544-406d-af8f-0f3ec445405a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fbf8cbcd-b88f-45bd-a45a-55827f41c2b3.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1d62ef05-abc6-4534-98bb-bf62f355edda.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69d07f73fff4d41966965df3/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fa866b01-d892-4f90-909e-54d9208959c0.jpeg","https://blintz-properties